//
// Compact block vectors. Generated with the reference implementation
// (dashpay/dash v24.0.0, 938fba5028).
//
// The literals in the program come from one testnet peer on 2026-11-16, for
// the blocks under 4 kB among 1592890 to 1592894: the cmpctblock reply, the
// getblocktxn sent for every transaction it left out, and the blocktxn reply.
//
// To run the program, paste it at the end of the `net_tests` suite in
// `src/test/net_tests.cpp` at the specified revision, include
// `blockencodings.h` there, build it with `make -C src test/test_dash` and
// run `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=net_tests/<name>`. The output should
// match the sections.
//
// Source: base-sdk branch `pasta/p2p-bip152-blocktx` at 681099d4, file `pkgs/p2p_core/corpus/compact.json5`.

